 Content Warranty.\n\n### COSMETIC (Formatting)\n*   **Version Update:** Contract version updated from 2.0 to 3.1.1 on Pages 1 and 5.\n*   **General Typography:** Minor corrections to punctuation, spacing, and standardized indentation throughout the document.\n*   **Pagination:** Re-pagination of Part 1 Section B following the removal of subsection 5."}, :command/name :sheet/complete-node-execution, :command/timestamp #time/offset-date-time "2026-05-19T21:07:56.393450-05:00", :command/id #uuid "1575f2b1-6688-428b-86bf-fcd5db1d6961", :duration-ms 3273, :usage {:prompt-tokens 1160, :completion-tokens 470, :total-tokens 1630}, :status :success, :node-id #uuid "b328407f-200e-4eb3-a4aa-9f8265828c8b", :sheet-id #uuid "345df149-dae9-48af-91ae-493c5ee1486e"}, :mulog/root-trace #mulog/flake "5A3Yy115NX-DajoByFfgOWwafG5yxxIW", :mulog/timestamp 1779242876393, :metric/name "CommandProcessed", :mulog/trace-id #mulog/flake "5A3Yy115NX-DajoByFfgOWwafG5yxxIW", :mulog/event-name :ai.obney.grain.command-processor-v2.core/process-command, :metric/resolution :high}
